    "type": "game",
    "name": "PianoGlow \ud83c\udfb9",
    "steam_appid": 3499520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer - play and listen to others around the globe! Queue-based multiplayer mode to take turns playing piano! Global chatroom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with both MIDI piano and QWERTY keyboard - that's right, play with your laptop/computer keyboard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ear training &amp; note reading game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning visuals &amp; particle effects that move in sync with the tempo of your playing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record &amp; load MIDI files (live play or render as video from within the app).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize by uploading a video file as a background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Circle-of-Fifths cheat sheet - clicking shows the common chord triads, key signature and the 7th chords.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-play QWERTY sheet music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize colors and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discord community to share QWERTY sheet music and your covers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable reverb &amp; equalizer audio effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chord Name Identifier &amp; Intervals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velocity integration with a few Analog QWERTY keyboards so that you can play with dynamics on the computer keyboard (loud &amp; soft).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show sheet staff notation for treble &amp; bass clefs while playing piano, to train note-reading ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload custom Soundfont (.sf2) files!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game currency with daily rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop to share and download QWERTY sheet music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer - play and listen to others around the globe! Queue-based multiplayer mode to take turns playing piano! Global chatroom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with both MIDI piano and QWERTY keyboard - that's right, play with your laptop/computer keyboard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ear training &amp; note reading game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning visuals &amp; particle effects that move in sync with the tempo of your playing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record &amp; load MIDI files (live play or render as video from within the app).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize by uploading a video file as a background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Circle-of-Fifths cheat sheet - clicking shows the common chord triads, key signature and the 7th chords.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-play QWERTY sheet music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize colors and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discord community to share QWERTY sheet music and your covers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable reverb &amp; equalizer audio effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chord Name Identifier &amp; Intervals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velocity integration with a few Analog QWERTY keyboards so that you can play with dynamics on the computer keyboard (loud &amp; soft).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show sheet staff notation for treble &amp; bass clefs while playing piano, to train note-reading ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload custom Soundfont (.sf2) files!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game currency with daily rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop to share and download QWERTY sheet music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Multiplayer piano (online queue-based modes). Play with a computer/laptop keyboard (or a piano)! Ear training and sheet training available! Stunning visuals/particles. Render video or save audio from within the app! Keep track of stats and unlock achievements.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cI'm actually a little addicted to this game. I love the gamified elements. I'm excited to come home and load it up every day. Its really made learning easy and effective with none of the chores that typically come with practicing.\u201d<br>Ayien<br><br>\u201cWith over 1000+ hours played, this is the best piano app I've tried. The people I've met in the multiplayer game mode made playing piano more fun!\u201d<br>Sxronxploits<br>",
